# 8. Important Wireshark Filters

## DNS

```text
dns
```

## HTTP

```text
http
```

## TLS / HTTPS

```text
tls
```

## ICMP

```text
icmp
```

## ARP

```text
arp
```

## TCP

```text
tcp
```

## Specific IP

```text
ip.addr == 192.168.1.10
```

## Source IP

```text
ip.src == 192.168.1.10
```

## Destination IP

```text
ip.dst == 8.8.8.8
```

## Specific Port

```text
tcp.port == 443
```

## TCP SYN

```text
tcp.flags.syn == 1
```

## TCP SYN Without ACK

```text
tcp.flags.syn == 1 && tcp.flags.ack == 0
```

This identifies initial TCP connection attempts.

