# 11. Statistics

Wireshark provides several useful statistics.

## Protocol Hierarchy

Shows the protocols observed in the capture.

Example:

```text
Ethernet
   └── IPv4
        └── TCP
             └── TLS
```

## Conversations

Shows communication between endpoints.

## Endpoints

Shows IP addresses involved in network communication.

## IO Graph

Shows network traffic over time.

Useful for identifying:

* Traffic spikes
* High-volume communication
* Possible network anomalies

