# 13. SOC Investigation Mindset

A SOC analyst should move beyond simply looking at packets.

The goal is to answer:

```text
Who communicated?
        ↓
Who was the destination?
        ↓
Which protocol was used?
        ↓
Which port was used?
        ↓
What type of communication occurred?
        ↓
Is the behavior expected?
        ↓
Could it indicate malicious activity?
```

